ther or not related to study vaccine, reported in addition to solicited and any solicited symptom with onset outside specified period of follow-up. Two-sided 95% confidence intervals were calculated according to Altman method.","populationDescription":"Safety population included all participants who entered into the study and received at least 1 dose of vaccination. Here \"Number Analyzed\" signifies participants evaluable for this outcome measure at specified rows.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"Percentage of Participants","timeFrame":"From Day 1 of vaccination up to Day 545 (Month 18)","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"VLA15 With Alum Lower Dose","description":"Main Study Phase: VLA15 with Alum lower dose - Booster Phase: arm discontinued VLA15: a multivalent recombinant Outer Surface Protein A (OspA) based vaccine candidate."},{"id":"OG001","title":"VLA15 With Alum Higher Dose","description":"Main Study Phase: VLA15 with Alum higher dose - Booster Phase: VLA15 higher dose or placebo VLA15: a multivalent recombinant Outer Surface Protein A (OspA) based vaccine candidate."},{"id":"OG002","title":"Placebo","description":"Main Study Phase: placebo - Booster Phase: arm discontinued Placebo: PBS (Phosphate Buffered Saline)."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"97"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"98"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"51"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"SAE: 18-49 Years","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"64"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"64"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"32"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"3.1","lowerLimit":"0.9","upperLimit":"10.7"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"3.1","lowerLimit":"0.9","upperLimit":"10.7"},{"groupId":"OG002","value":"0.0","lowerLimit":"0.0","upperLimit":"10.7"}]}]},{"title":"SAE: 50-65 Years","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","va